OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA chilly but bright start.
OL,6,FTurning cloudy into the afternoon from
OL,7,Fthe west, with this thickening before
OL,8,Fthe rain arriving by the evening.
OL,9,FFeeling pleasant in the sunshine and
OL,10,Flight winds initially, but winds
OL,11,Fpicking up later.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloudy with persistent rain
OL,14,Ftonight, heavy at times into the early
OL,15,Fhours of Friday. Feeling much milder
OL,16,Fthan last night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
