OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FRain, sometimes heavy, will
OL,6,Fclear through Friday morning to become
OL,7,Fbright with scattered showers. A
OL,8,Fstrong westerly breeze, especially on
OL,9,Fwestern hills.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:
OL,12,FScattered showers continuing through
OL,13,FSaturday, easing into Sunday alongside
OL,14,Fwinds allowing for sunny intervals.
OL,15,FCloud building through the evening
OL,16,Fwith rain to follow into Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
